### 查询当前用户  通过token访问的格式如下：Authorization: Bearer
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIxMyIsInJvbGUiOiJwdWJsaWMiLCJ0eXBlIjoiYWNjZXNzIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg5MzY5MTIyfQ.KFPXCppHQh9ptFV8eo2i3NLy51-C5US9Ju7LbZ1z93M

### 更新当前用户  通过token访问的格式如下：Authorization: Bearer
